- [L2] LSC3 failed: Guards outgoing from XOR/OR branches must cover the whole evaluated state space. | Branch `b1` cannot be evaluated: `v1` has no declared range. | Branch `b2` cannot be evaluated: `v2` has no declared range. | Branch `b3` cannot be evaluated: `v3` has no declared range.
